# Wails / build output
build/bin
node_modules/

# The built frontend is ignored but the directory itself is not, because main.go
# embeds all:frontend/dist and an embed target that matches nothing is a compile
# error rather than a warning: a fresh clone would not vet, test, lint, or build.
# The placeholder keeps that target satisfiable until `wails build` fills it in.
# Note the /* rather than a bare path: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded. The `all:` embed prefix includes dotfiles too; this
# non-dot filename just makes the placeholder's purpose visible at a glance.
frontend/dist/*
!frontend/dist/DIST.placeholder

# Rewritten by `wails build` to decide whether `npm install` is needed, so it is
# cache state rather than a source file, and a stale copy only causes noise.
frontend/package.json.md5

# Go
*.test
*.out
coverage.*
vendor/

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Local scratch
*.log
tmp/
